    @warm @serial
    Scenario Outline: Overwrite/confirm after cold start (no restart)
        Given Set the actuator signal <path> to <datatype> <default_value>
        When HeadlessApp set the actuator signal <path> to <datatype> <checked_value>
        Then the result obtained from the actuator signal by PAL should be <datatype> <checked_value> on <path>

    Examples:
        | path                                                     | datatype | default_value | checked_value |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsLocked | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsOpen | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Horn.IsActive | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.IsAutoPowerOptimize | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Backup.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.High.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Beam.Low.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Brake.IsActive | string | ACTIVE | INACTIVE |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.DirectionIndicator.Left.IsSignaling | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.DirectionIndicator.Right.IsSignaling | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Fog.Front.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Fog.Rear.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Hazard.IsSignaling | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.LicensePlate.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Parking.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Lights.Running.IsOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.DriverSide.IsFolded | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.DriverSide.IsHeatingOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.DriverSide.IsLocked | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.DriverSide.Tilt | int8 | 0 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.DriverSide.Yaw | int8 | 0 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.PassengerSide.IsFolded | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.PassengerSide.IsHeatingOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.PassengerSide.IsLocked | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.PassengerSide.Tilt | int8 | 0 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Mirrors.PassengerSide.Yaw | int8 | 0 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.PowerOptimizeLevel | uint8 | 5 | 10 |
        | Vehicle.Body.RearMainSpoilerPosition | float | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Front.IsLightOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Front.IsLocked | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Front.IsOpen | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Front.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Rear.IsLightOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Rear.IsLocked | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Rear.IsOpen | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Trunk.Rear.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.IsHeatingOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.Wiping.Intensity | uint8 | 127 | 255 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.Wiping.Mode | string | SLOW | OFF |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.Wiping.System.Frequency | uint8 | 127 | 255 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.Wiping.System.Mode | string | WIPE | STOP_HOLD |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Front.Wiping.System.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.IsHeatingOn | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.Wiping.Intensity | uint8 | 127 | 255 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.Wiping.Mode | string | SLOW | OFF |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.Wiping.System.Frequency | uint8 | 127 | 255 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.Wiping.System.Mode | string | WIPE | STOP_HOLD |
        | Vehicle.Body.Windshield.Rear.Wiping.System.Position | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        
    Scenario Outline: Millions of set requests do not kill kura server & values remain consistent
        When HeadlessApp set the signal <path> to <datatype> <checked_value> <count> times with duplex <duplex>
        Then the result obtained from the actuator signal by PAL should be <datatype> <checked_value> on <path>

    Examples:
        | path                                                     | count            | duplex           | datatype      | default_value | checked_value |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsLocked | 20 | 10 | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.IsOpen | 20 | 10 | bool | false | true |
        | Vehicle.Body.Hood.Position | 20 | 10 | uint8 | 50 | 100 |
        | Vehicle.Body.Horn.IsActive | 20 | 10 | bool | false | true |
